{"body":"Victor — here's the line for Thursday's pack, based on Mark's position as of today:

Of the 8 pending registrations: 3 units are already on site awaiting PDI and sign-off (registrable in November); the iX1 eDrive20 lands 26 Nov and the first 120 Sport 30 Nov (both register early December); the second 120 Sport lands 5 Dec (mid-December); the X3 20 xDrive (25 Dec) and 320d Touring (26 Dec) are factory builds, registering late December — realistically slipping into early January.

So November shows the recovery starting with 3 (up to 5 if the late-Nov arrivals turn quickly), December 3, with 2 at the Dec/Jan boundary. The zero is timing, not demand — agreed, and I'll use the BMW web-lead campaign ask for approved-used EVs on Friday.","subject":"Re: New car registrations vs target - Friday prep","reply_to":"MSG-000791","to":"victor-hale"}

